  "project_description": "This module provides a toolset for developers when working with config. An extension of Core's ConfigFormBase class builds configuration forms automatically from config schema. Write less PHP in exchange for writing little to no additional YAML.\n\n Many core data types are supported out of the box, and additional submodules provide support for more types from core and contrib. Additional data types can be supported in other modules via plugins.",
